  "body": "Viewing Sunday 1.30pm\r\nFamily is calling and our vendors are ready for their next move. The decision has been made - creating an opportunity for someone else to secure this very special piece of the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned above beautiful Stanmore Bay Beach, 236 Vipond Road offers elevated beachfront living without the beachfront price tag. Premium, private and incredibly versatile, this is a coastal home designed to make the most of its spectacular setting.  Wake to stunning sunrises and ocean views, then wander down your own private track directly to Stanmore Bay Beach - a locally loved stretch of coastline that still feels like one of the Coast's best-kept secrets.\r\n\r\nCompleted in 2018/2019, quality, longevity and future living were front of mind. No expense was spared in creating a home of exceptional quality, with thoughtful attention to detail and a level of finish many can only dream of.  Significant investment was made in the footings during construction, with a geotechnical report available on file for purchasers, reflecting the care and consideration that went into the home from the ground up.\r\n\r\nGenerous, sun-filled living spaces flow effortlessly outdoors, while the separate downstairs accommodation provides genuine flexibility - perfect for extended family, teenagers, guests, Airbnb or an additional income stream.\r\n\r\nWHY 236 VIPOND ROAD?\r\nMotivated Vendors\r\nElevated beachfront living\r\nPrivate track directly to Stanmore Bay Beach\r\nSpectacular ocean views and sunrises\r\nSeparate downstairs accommodation - Legal 2-bedroom income \r\nCouncil Geotechnical report available on file\r\nSignificant investment made in the home's footings\r\nInternal provision for a potential future elevator\r\nGenerous, light-filled living and entertaining\r\nPeaceful, private coastal position\r\n\r\nOUR VENDORS ARE READY - ARE YOU?\r\n\r\nElevated beachfront living, flexibility and income potential - opportunities like this are hard to replace.\r\nWhen you know… you know. Don't let this be the one you wished you'd acted on.\r\n\r\nConjunctionals Welcome\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/MUGC",
